
---

### ✅ 2. Actualizar el workflow si quieres usar **Trivy oficial (recomendado)**
Reemplaza tu `.github/workflows/devsecops.yml` por este actualizado (no descarga manualmente nada):

```yaml
name: DevSecOps Pipeline

on:
  push:
    branches: [ main ]
  pull_request:
    branches: [ main ]

jobs:
  build-and-scan:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest

    steps:
    - name: 📥 Checkout del código
      uses: actions/checkout@v4

    - name: 🐳 Configurar Docker Buildx
      uses: docker/setup-buildx-action@v3

    - name: 🏗️ Construir imagen Docker
      run: docker build -t devsecops-lab:${{ github.sha }} .

    - name: 🔍 Escanear imagen Docker con Trivy
      uses: aquasecurity/trivy-action@master
      with:
        image-ref: devsecops-lab:${{ github.sha }}
        vuln-type: 'os,library'
        format: 'table'
        severity: 'HIGH,CRITICAL'
        ignore-unfixed: true
        exit-code: '0'
